<title>USA: W.Hempstead UFSD, NY., $2.800 mln won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>W.Hempstead UFSD, NY., $2.800 mln won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $2.800 million of West Hempstead UFSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997 Series B, witha net interest cost of 4.6246 percent.</p>
